      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Ever since the first whispers about Google's IPO, most investors have feared that the stock would come public at such a ridiculously high price that, even with a spectacularly profitable business model and some nearly flawless execution, the price would be too high for investors to make a real profit."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
