      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Remember when a whole lot of people had to die because a Swedish newspaper printed those cartoons of the Prophet Mohammed?"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0002",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Now Iran wants to turn the tables and is inviting cartoonists to do their best by depicting the Holocaust."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0003",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Amazingly, these idiots think a cartoon of Mohammed is comparable to what we can expect in this new fun contest:"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
