      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "TEHRAN (AFP) -"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0005",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "An international contest of cartoons on the Holocaust opened in Tehran in response to the publication in Western papers last September of caricatures of the Prophet Mohammed."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0006",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "\"We staged this fair to explore the limits of freedom Westerners believe in,\" Masoud Shojai, head of the country's \"Iran Cartoon\" association and the fair organizer, said."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0007",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "\"They can freely write anything they like about our prophet, but if one raises doubts about the Holocaust he is either fined or sent to prison,\" he added."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0008",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "\"Though we do not deny that fact that Jews were killed in the (second world) war, why should the Palestinians pay for it?\""
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0009",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Shojai told the opening ceremony of the month-long fair in Tehran's Palestine Contemporary Art Museum."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0010",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "He added that around 1,100 cartoons were submitted by participants from more than 60 countries and that more than 200 are on show."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0011",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "He said the top three cartoons will be announced on September 2, with the winners being awarded prizes of 12,000, 8,000 and 5,000 dollars respectively."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0012",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "This cute little stunt is only going to prove just how fanatic the extremist Muslims are."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0013",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "When they saw a cartoon of their prophet, people had to die."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-blogspot.com_aggressivevoicedaily_20060814163400_ENG_20060814_163400-0014",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "When their precious cartoons are released I highly doubt it will look like the end of the world."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
