      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Armed clashes broke out in several northern Iraqi cities on Wednesday, leaving some 22 persons dead in Mosul, Baiji, and Tuz."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0004",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Hundreds of persons mounted demonstrations against the Fallujah campaign in Tikrit and Huwaijah, as well, according to az-Zaman ."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0005",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "The battles and demonstrations were provoked by the US assault on Fallujah."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0006",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Guerrillas threatened to assassinate Prime Minister Iyad Allawi and Minister of Defense Hazem Shaalan in retaliation for the attack."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0007",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Allawi's aged cousin and the man's wife and daughter-in-law were abducted and guerrillas threaten to behead them if the Fallujah compaign is not stopped."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0008",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "In Iraqi society, PM Allawi is responsible for protecting his clan, including especially his first cousins, so this kidnapping makes him look weak and brings substantial shame on him."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0009",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "The US Marines took most of Fallujah Wednesday, but still face pockets of resistance."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0010",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "If Samarra and other cities are any guide, those pockets of resistance could go on bedeviling the US for some time to come."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
      "record_id": "ud:en_ewt:weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041111060900_ENG_20041111_060900-0011",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-02",
      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "The intrepid Ed Wong of the NYT has more on the Sunni boycott of the elections."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
      "origin_url": "https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT",
