      "section": "grammar",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "universal-dependencies",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "Jim Lobe has more on the political implications of the Fallujah assault, both in Iraq and in Washington."
    },
    {
